12:Tc70,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I download a TikTok video using CekAPK?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Open TikTok and copy the link of a public video. Visit this page, paste the link into the input field, and press Get Video. Check the preview — the title and creator should match the video you meant — then press the download option you need. The file saves to your device's Downloads folder."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is CekAPK's TikTok downloader free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, it is free and needs no account. The tool is supported by our site generally, not by locking results or charging per video. A fair hourly usage limit exists to prevent server abuse, not to sell access."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need to install an application?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The tool runs in your browser on Android, iPhone, and desktop computers. Nothing is installed, so your storage is untouched and no extra app asks for strange permissions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need to log in to TikTok?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. The tool only reads the video's public page data, and it never asks for a TikTok password, a verification code, or an app install. Any downloader site that asks for your TikTok password should be closed immediately — passwords belong only in TikTok's own app and website."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which TikTok links are supported?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Full video links from tiktok.com, www.tiktok.com, and m.tiktok.com in the form /video/<number>, and short links from the share button (vt.tiktok.com and vm.tiktok.com) — the server follows those to the original video. Photo posts are not downloadable: the tool accepts the link but the source provides no video file, and it will say so plainly."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why is my TikTok video not downloading?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"First check that the link was copied in full and the video is still public. TikTok sometimes limits access from servers, so if the source is unreachable, wait a few minutes and try again. The no-watermark option appears only when TikTok's public page provides it for that video. Download links are valid for 10 minutes — if yours expired, process the link again."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I download private TikTok videos?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Private, friends-only, and deleted videos have no public data, and this tool uses no account, password, or workaround to get past the owner's privacy settings. If a video is not public, the tool explains that and stops."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it legal to download TikTok videos?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Downloading a video for personal archiving is generally different from publishing it again as your own. Re-uploading someone else's work without permission violates copyright and TikTok's terms, and your account can face action from the platform. Use this tool only for your own videos or content whose permission is clear."}}]}e:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-8 py-8","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"English Home\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/en\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Tools\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/en/tools\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"TikTok Video Downloader\",\"item\":\"https://cekapk.com/en/tools/tiktok-downloader\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$12"}}],"$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20"]}],null,"$L21"]}]
